{"strongs": "H2429", "word": "חול", "translit": "cha.yil", "root": "חול", "morph": "A:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "power, strength, army", "definition": "חַ֫יִל noun masculine power, strength, army (see Biblical Hebrew II. חול , חיל ); — 1. power: absolute בְּאֶדְרָע וְחָ֑יִל Ezra 4:23 by force and power ; ׳ קרא בְח i.e. call loudly Dan 3:4 , בְּחַיִל Dan 4:11 ; Dan 5:7 ׳ גִּבָּרֵיאח Dan 3:20 mighty men of power. 2. force, army , suffix חֵילֵהּ Dan 3:20 construct חֵיל שְׁמַיָּא Dan 4:32 (= Biblical Hebrew צְכָא הַשָּׁמַיִם ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9524')\">BDB9524</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2428')\">H2428</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2429')\">H2429</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9523')\">BDB9523</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9525')\">BDB9525</entry></div><p> <bdbarc>חַ֫יִל</bdbarc> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>power, strength, army</highlightword> (see Biblical Hebrew II.  <bdbheb><reflink>חול</reflink></bdbheb>, <bdbarc>חיל</bdbarc>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>power:</highlight> absolute <bdbarc>בְּאֶדְרָע וְחָ֑יִל</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:23\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,23)\">Ezra 4:23</ref> <highlight>by force and power</highlight>; <bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>קרא בְח</bdbarc> i.e. <highlight>call loudly</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,4)\">Dan 3:4</ref>, <bdbarc>בְּחַיִל</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,11)\">Dan 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 5:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,7)\">Dan 5:7</ref> <bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>גִּבָּרֵיאח</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,20)\">Dan 3:20</ref> <highlight>mighty men of power.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>force, army</highlight>, suffix <bdbarc>חֵילֵהּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,20)\">Dan 3:20</ref> construct <bdbarc>חֵיל שְׁמַיָּא</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:32\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,32)\">Dan 4:32</ref> (= Biblical Hebrew <bdbarc>צְכָא הַשָּׁמַיִם</bdbarc>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ezra 4:23", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 4, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Dan 3:4", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 3, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Dan 4:11", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Dan 5:7", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Dan 3:20", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 3, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Dan 4:32", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 32}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חול"], "aramaic": ["חַ֫יִל", "חיל", "בְּאֶדְרָע וְחָ֑יִל", "׳", "קרא בְח", "בְּחַיִל", "גִּבָּרֵיאח", "חֵילֵהּ", "חֵיל שְׁמַיָּא", "צְכָא הַשָּׁמַיִם"], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": ["H2428", "H2429"], "bdbid": "BDB9524", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}